	"data": "Project Mirror: The Holographic Self\n\nLook into a mirror and see yourself on every level — medical, spiritual, emotional. The \"glasses for the mind\" made literal and visual.\n\nThe Original Vision (Brain.docx, ~Oct 2019)\n\nFrom the same 1:30 AM session that named Calcifer and described the Brain System, cithoreal laid out Project Mirror:\n\n\"That's going to be Project Mirror. You can look into it, see yourself on many different levels.\"\n\nThe concept was simple and radical simultaneously: a mirror…",
